 </span><span begin="00:39.238" end="00:39.445">I've </span><span begin="00:39.445" end="00:39.670">been </span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:39.951">too </span><span begin="00:39.951" end="00:40.326">much </span><span begin="00:40.326" end="00:40.573">for </span><span begin="00:40.573" end="00:40.870">your </span><span begin="00:40.870" end="00:41.757">heart </span><span begin="00:42.021" end="00:42.653">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.990" end="00:45.957"><span begin="00:42.990" end="00:43.221">I </span><span begin="00:43.221" end="00:43.486">can't </span><span begin="00:43.486" end="00:43.686">give </span><span begin="00:43.686" end="00:43.949">it </span><span begin="00:43.949" end="00:44.350">all </span><span begin="00:44.350" end="00:44.653">to </span><span begin="00:44.653" end="00:44.958">you </span><span begin="00:44.958" end="00:45.957">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.950" end="00:50.952"><span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.221">I </span><span begin="00:47.221" end="00:47.534">don't </span><span begin="00:47.534" end="00:47.870">wanna </span><span begin="00:48.102" end="00:48.437">tear </span><span begin="00:48.437" end="00:48.846">us </span><span begin="00:48.846" end="00:49.718">apart </span><span begin="00:50.141" end="00:50.952">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.261" end="00:52.862"><span begin="00:51.261" end="00:51.469">If </span><span begin="00:51.469" end="00:51.759">we're </span><span begin="00:51.759" end="00:52.119">beyond </span><span begin="00:52.119" end="00:52.862">saving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.054" end="00:54.294"><span begin="00:53.054" end="00:53.237">Why </span><span begin="00:53.237" end="00:53.422">do </span><span begin="00:53.422" end="00:53.679">you </span><span begin="00:53.679" end="00:54.294">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.536" end="00:56.150"><span begin="00:54.536" end="00:54.725">Am </span><span begin="00:54.725" end="00:54.885">I </span><span begin="00:54.885